# Agent capture

Prompt/response capture is automatic via Cursor hooks in `.cursor/hooks.json`. The hook script is `.cursor/hooks/capture.py`.

Do not edit, tidy, summarise, or delete entries in `.agent-logs/` after they are written. Do not add `.agent-logs/` to `.gitignore`.
